@startuml
' Architecture ticket 496; Product UC-001, UC-002, UC-003의 runner lifecycle.
title Ticket 496 — 평가 케이스 lifecycle과 cleanup finalization
[*] --> planned
planned --> running : preflight / provision 성공
planned --> inconclusive : preflight 실패
state running {
  [*] --> launch_observe
  state "launch / observe" as launch_observe
  state "안전 경계 적용" as safety
  state "증거 수집" as collect
  state grade
  state "execution_result: passed" as exec_passed
  state "execution_result: failed" as exec_failed
  state "execution_result: inconclusive" as exec_inconclusive
  launch_observe --> safety
  safety --> collect
  collect --> grade
  grade --> exec_passed : passed
  grade --> exec_failed : failed
  grade --> exec_inconclusive : inconclusive
}
running --> cleanup : execution result 기록
cleanup --> passed : execution passed + cleanup passed
cleanup --> failed : execution failed + cleanup passed
cleanup --> inconclusive : cleanup 실패 / worktree_leak / workspace_cleanup_failure
note right of cleanup
cleanup 전에 event evidence를 보존한다.
cleanup 실패는 별도로 기록하고 최종 상태를 inconclusive로 승격한다.
end note
note right of inconclusive
cleanup leak은 새 dispatch와 영향받은 pool 재사용을 차단한다.
관련 없는 running 케이스는 계속 실행한다.
end note
note bottom
최종 상태: planned, running, passed, failed, inconclusive.
execution_result는 최종 케이스 상태와 구분된다.
end note
@enduml
